Drop CloudSaveManager on the same GameObject as PitySystem (or any DontDestroyOnLoad object).
Set provider to CustomHTTP and fill in your backend URL + player ID.
Everything else is automatic:PitySystem saves → local file + queued upload
On start → download + smart merge → apply to PitySystem
Offline → works normally, syncs when back online
Conflicts → keeps the highest pity value per track (safe for players)
